<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Market Direction AI</title>

<style>
*{
  box-sizing:border-box;
  margin:0;
  padding:0;
  font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

body{
  background:#07111f;
  color:#ffffff;
  min-height:100vh;
}

.header{
  padding:20px 16px;
  background:#0b1728;
  border-bottom:1px solid #20344d;
}

.header h1{
  font-size:24px;
}

.header p{
  margin-top:5px;
  color:#8fa4bd;
  font-size:13px;
}

.demo{
  display:inline-block;
  margin-top:10px;
  padding:5px 9px;
  border-radius:5px;
  background:#3b2d0b;
  color:#ffd45a;
  font-size:11px;
}

.container{
  padding:15px;
  padding-bottom:90px;
}

.market-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
  gap:12px;
}

.card{
  background:#0d1b2d;
  border:1px solid #20344d;
  border-radius:12px;
  padding:15px;
}

.card h3{
  color:#9db0c5;
  font-size:13px;
  margin-bottom:8px;
}

.price{
  font-size:22px;
  font-weight:bold;
}

.up{
  color:#35d07f;
}

.down{
  color:#ff5c6c;
}

.section-title{
  margin:22px 0 10px;
  font-size:17px;
}

.direction{
  text-align:center;
  padding:22px 15px;
}

.direction h2{
  font-size:30px;
  margin:10px 0;
}

.confidence{
  font-size:14px;
  color:#aebed0;
}

.probability{
  margin-top:18px;
}

.bar{
  height:10px;
  background:#1c2b3d;
  border-radius:10px;
  overflow:hidden;
  margin-top:6px;
}

.bar-fill{
  height:100%;
  width:68%;
  background:#35d07f;
}

.alert{
  border-left:4px solid #ffd45a;
}

.alert p{
  color:#bdc9d7;
  margin-top:7px;
  line-height:1.5;
  font-size:13px;
}

.data-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
  gap:10px;
}

.data-item{
  background:#101f32;
  padding:12px;
  border-radius:9px;
}

.data-item span{
  display:block;
  color:#8fa4bd;
  font-size:12px;
  margin-bottom:5px;
}

.bottom-nav{
  position:fixed;
  bottom:0;
  left:0;
  right:0;
  height:65px;
  background:#0b1728;
  border-top:1px solid #20344d;
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-around;
  align-items:center;
}

.bottom-nav div{
  text-align:center;
  color:#8fa4bd;
  font-size:11px;
}

.bottom-nav .active{
  color:#ffffff;
}

.icon{
  font-size:20px;
  display:block;
  margin-bottom:3px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header class="header">
  <h1>Market Direction AI</h1>
  <p>NIFTY 50 & SENSEX Market Intelligence</p>
  <span class="demo">DEMO VERSION</span>
</header>

<main class="container">

  <div class="market-grid">

    <div class="card">
      <h3>NIFTY 50</h3>
      <div class="price">25,850</div>
      <div class="up">▲ +0.62%</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>SENSEX</h3>
      <div class="price">84,650</div>
      <div class="up">▲ +0.55%</div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title">Tomorrow Direction</h2>

  <div class="card direction">

    <h3>NIFTY 50</h3>

    <h2 class="up">UP ↑</h2>

    <div class="confidence">
      AI Confidence: 68%
    </div>

    <div class="probability">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;">
        <span>UP Probability</span>
        <span>68%</span>
      </div>

      <div class="bar">
        <div class="bar-fill"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title">Market Alert</h2>

  <div class="card alert">
    <h3>⚠ Important Alert</h3>
    <p>
      Sudden news, global markets, FII/DII activity,
      VIX and option-chain changes can change the market direction.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title">Market Data</h2>

  <div class="data-grid">

    <div class="data-item">
      <span>India VIX</span>
      <b>14.20</b>
    </div>

    <div class="data-item">
      <span>PCR</span>
      <b>1.08</b>
    </div>

    <div class="data-item">
      <span>FII</span>
      <b class="down">-₹850 Cr</b>
    </div>

    <div class="data-item">
      <span>DII</span>
      <b class="up">+₹1,120 Cr</b>
    </div>

  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title">AI Status</h2>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>Signal</h3>
    <div style="margin-top:8px;font-size:20px;" class="up">
      CALL BIAS
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:8px;color:#8fa4bd;font-size:12px;">
      Demo signal — real-time AI engine will be connected later.
    </p>
  </div>

</main>

<nav class="bottom-nav">
  <div class="active">
    <span class="icon">📊</span>
    Dashboard
  </div>

  <div>
    <span class="icon">⛓️</span>
    Option Chain
  </div>

  <div>
    <span class="icon">📰</span>
    News
  </div>

  <div>
    <span class="icon">⚙️</span>
    Settings
  </div>
</nav>

</body>
</html>
